      Q. Q. 2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمَغْثَرَ</span></b>  <i>He gathered</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُغْثُور</span> [q. v.].
